// Tile: Alert level changes, last 24 hours
// Visual: Table. Shows every capacity, so it does not use the parameter.
// Conditional formatting on To: "critical" red, "warning" orange, "ok" green.
CapacityAlertHistory(24)
| project Time = as_of_local, Capacity = capacity_label, From = previous_level, To = alert_level, Reason = reason
